Yes, wands of draining are extremely dangerous to an unprepared
character in the Guild Level.  If you prepare correctly, the level is
extremely easy.

1) Crystal Golems are drain resistant.
2) A scroll of earth is a good way to keep most of the DA's from
attacking you.
3) A ring of protection from shape changers is ideal for protecting
yourself from other doppelgangers.
4) The best way to clear the level is to insta-kill all the DA's on the
level before they can use up their valuable potions/scrolls/wands.  You
could lay a large bunch of basilisk pets, speed them up with a wand of
speed monster, enter the level with all your pets, magic map the level,
teleport across the level away from the crowd, read a scroll of earth,
and clean up the statues later.  Some of them will have gone up to the
higher level from drinking cursed !oGL, so be prepared to clean them up
later.
5) A blessed figurine of a Solar is another option for clearing out the
level, but some DA's will then escape with wands of digging.

Happy Hacking.

